    <item>
      <title>Sponsor</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/sponsor/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/sponsor/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Who We Are&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;who-we-are&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#who-we-are&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;TheHomeLab documents the real-world journey of running a self-hosted homelab — from bare-metal Proxmox clusters to Docker stacks, infrastructure-as-code, 3D printed lab gear, and everything in between.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We write detailed companion guides for every project so readers can follow along, reproduce the setup, and go deeper than a video allows.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;The Audience&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;the-audience&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#the-audience&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Our readers are &lt;strong&gt;technical homelab operators&lt;/strong&gt; — sysadmins, DevOps engineers, software developers, and self-hosting enthusiasts who run real infrastructure at home and want to learn from someone doing the same.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
